    </h1>
    <h1 class="mb-0 ml-2 nextbtn" style=" font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 400; line-height: 19px; letter-spacing: 0em; text-align: left; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);">
        <img src="~/images/next.svg" alt="" width="25px" />
